{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":63,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["主报应列国"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["这位身披红衣、",{"text":"穿着华丽、充满力量、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从以东的波斯拉阔步而来的是谁呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“是宣告公义、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有拯救大能的我。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"你的衣服为何是红色的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像榨酒池中踩踏葡萄者的衣服？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"“我独自在榨酒池踩踏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万民中无人跟我在一起。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我愤然踩踏他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"发烈怒践踏他们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的血溅到我的衣服上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"玷污了我的衣服。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我心中定了报仇的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我救赎我子民之年已经来临。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我环顾四周，却无人帮助，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因无人扶持而惊讶。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"于是，在烈怒的推动下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我用自己的臂膀施行拯救。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在愤怒中践踏万民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让他们饱尝我的烈怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把他们的血倒在地上。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["颂赞与祷告"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"因耶和华为我们所做的一切，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要述说祂的慈爱和祂可歌可颂的作为，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"述说祂凭怜悯和大爱赐给以色列人的厚恩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂说：“他们的确是我的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不会背叛我。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，祂做他们的救主。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂苦他们所苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亲自","poem":1},{"noteId":25},{"text":"拯救他们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂本着慈爱和怜悯救赎了他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自古以来一直扶持、照顾他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"他们却叛逆，使祂的圣灵忧伤。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"于是，祂转而与他们为敌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亲自攻击他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"后来，他们想起古时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"想起了摩西和他的百姓，便问，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"带领百姓及其牧者摩西从海里出来的那位在哪里？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将自己的圣灵降在他们中间的那位在哪里？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用荣耀的臂膀扶持摩西，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在他们面前把海水分开，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使自己威名永存的那位在哪里？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"带领他们经过大海，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹如马行平川不会失脚的那位在哪里？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的灵使他们得到安歇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹如牲畜下到山谷。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，你就是这样引领你的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以树立自己荣耀的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你从天上垂顾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从你圣洁、荣耀的居所垂看。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的热忱和大能在哪里呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道你不再眷爱、怜悯我们吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽然亚伯拉罕不认识我们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列不承认我们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你是我们的父亲。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，你是我们的父亲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自古以来你就是我们的救赎主。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊！你为何使我们偏离你的路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我们硬着心不敬畏你呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你为了你的仆人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的产业——以色列各支派而回心转意！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的圣民曾暂时拥有你的圣所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今我们的敌人已经践踏了它。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们如此沦落，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像从未被你治理过，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从来不属于你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":25,"caller":"+","text":"“亲自”希伯来文是“祂面前的天使”。","reference":{"chapter":63,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/63.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/64.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/62.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":19}